    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p0",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dear Mr. Roger Federer,"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It’s really a great honour for me to write to you and I’m doing so to tell you that I’m a huge "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of yours. You "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "devoted",
            "ref": "v-devote"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "enthusiasm",
            "ref": "v-enthusiasm"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to just one thing, tennis, a sport and hobby you’ve "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for over 20 years."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I came to know you because of my father who always "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " highly of you. He never "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " any of your matches on TV, enjoying your every appearance and performance. And every time he watches you, there’s always a little "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " beside him watching, too—ME! We love you sooooooooooo madly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Because of my father, I have "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to love the sport. I’ve learnt so much about it just by watching it and I’ve learnt about your "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " career."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I am so deeply "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "impressed",
            "ref": "v-impress"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by your "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "perseverance",
            "zh": "毅力"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". As a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of 13 Stefan Edberg Sportsmanship Awards, 19 ATP Fans’ Favourite awards, 20 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Grand Slam singles titles",
            "zh": "单打冠军头衔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", 103 ATP singles titles, you’ve been such a perfect "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for millions of teenagers, including me."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "From you, I’ve learnt that great performance comes from not only great strength but also strong "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and perseverance. I will take my hobbies and studies "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I will not "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " any piano lessons by saying “next time” as an excuse for not being willing to practise."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Your "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fighting spirit",
            "ref": "v-fighting-spirit"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " will always enlighten me and inspire me to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I will follow your "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to success."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you all the best!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Your faithful fan,"
          },
          {
            "t": "br"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Carol"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
